{
  "schemaVersion": "akm.eval.config.v1",
  "run": {
    "id": "longmemeval-qwen35-9b-q4km-131k-v1",
    "outputDir": "runs/reference/longmemeval-qwen35-9b-q4km-131k-v1"
  },
  "packs": [
    {
      "id": "longmemeval-qwen35-9b-q4km-131k-v1",
      "adapter": "longmemeval",
      "enabled": true,
      "config": {
        "datasetPath": "datasets/longmemeval/dataset.json",
        "evaluatorCommand": "python3 scripts/longmemeval-evaluator.py",
        "evaluatorModel": "gpt-4o",
        "smoke": false,
        "resume": true,
        "topK": 5
      }
    }
  ],
  "variants": [
    {
      "id": "baseline",
      "agent": {
        "provider": "openai-compatible",
        "providerRef": "ai-lab",
        "model": "qwen3.5-9b"
      },
      "akm": { "enabled": false },
      "memory": { "backend": "none" }
    },
    {
      "id": "raw-vector",
      "agent": {
        "provider": "openai-compatible",
        "providerRef": "ai-lab",
        "model": "qwen3.5-9b"
      },
      "akm": { "enabled": false },
      "memory": { "backend": "raw-vector" }
    },
    {
      "id": "akm-memory-lead",
      "agent": {
        "provider": "openai-compatible",
        "providerRef": "ai-lab",
        "model": "qwen3.5-9b"
      },
      "akm": { "enabled": false },
      "memory": {
        "backend": "akm",
        "config": {
          "fragmentContext": {
            "mode": "lead",
            "maxChars": 3200
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "providers": {
    "ai-lab": {
      "type": "openai-compatible",
      "baseURL": "{env:LAB_AI_BASE_URL}",
      "apiKey": "{env:LAB_API_KEY}",
      "defaultModel": "qwen3.5-9b",
      "timeout": 600000,
      "options": {
        "temperature": 0,
        "max_tokens": 256,
        "seed": 1337,
        "chat_template_kwargs": {
          "enable_thinking": false
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "judging": {
    "enabled": true,
    "provider": "openai",
    "model": "gpt-4o",
    "temperature": 0
  },
  "telemetry": {
    "trackTokens": true,
    "trackCost": true,
    "trackLatency": true,
    "captureLogs": true
  },
  "notes": [
    "Reusable small-model reference: all 500 official LongMemEval questions, local qwen3.5-9b Q4_K_M answers from a pinned llama.cpp container on one RTX 4060 Ti, and the official GPT-4o judge.",
    "The local answer server must expose one context slot of at least 131072 tokens. Baseline receives the full haystack; raw-vector and AKM receive only topK=5 retrieved context. AKM uses the 0.9.15 lead fragment contract capped at 3200 characters.",
    "The provider id remains ai-lab solely because bin/memory-eval currently selects its safe env forwarding path by providerRef; LAB_AI_BASE_URL is set to the local Docker host endpoint and LAB_API_KEY is a non-secret local placeholder. The recorded base URL and resolved model census are authoritative."
  ]
}
